  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the attainment of food security through the reduction of post-harvest losses in horticultural crops - (Recoded to Entity no. 706006 from biennium of funding 2022-23 to 2024-25)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To collect baseline information (through a survey) on post-harvest handling practices in the horticultural subsector to identify critical post-harvest loss points in the supply chain (in terms of both quantities and quality).</narrative>
  </description>
